---
// Unlinked guide for the "TVC Members: Your Story" Google Form - explains
// what the form is for and exactly what happens to a response after
// submitting (review, manual merge, no auto-publish). Deliberately not in
// Nav, not in the sitemap (see astro.config.mjs's sitemap filter), and
// noindex'd below - reachable only by whoever we send this direct link to,
// same unlinked-page pattern as /internal/photo-pool.astro.
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const FORM_URL = 'https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScH8mWVrzD3wIG44QsMe1MrpLxaaieKRRRyck2XvCzOIlaf1g/viewform';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sharing Your Story"
  description={`A guide to the "TVC Members: Your Story" form - what it's for, and exactly what happens after you submit.`}
  image="/images/journey/journey-43.jpg"
  imageWidth={1400}
  imageHeight={787}
  noindex
  translated={false}
>
  <section class="section wrapper">
    <div class="doc">
      <header class="doc-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Tamarind Valley Collective</span>
        <h1>Sharing your story with the collective</h1>
        <p class="subhead">A short guide to the "TVC Members: Your Story" form — what it's for, and exactly what happens after you submit.</p>
        <p class="intro">
          People who find tvc.farm are often curious about the families behind it — what everyone does, why they joined, what keeps them here. Right now most member cards on the site are a one-line job title from 2017. We're asking each household to add a bit more: what you do today, your family if you'd like, one line on <strong>why TVC</strong>, and a photo or social link if you want one. <strong>Everything is optional except your name and the "why" line</strong> — fill in only what you're comfortable sharing.
        </p>
        <figure class="shot">
          <img src="/images/pages/members-story-guide/form.jpg" alt='The top of the "TVC Members: Your Story" form, showing the header photo and intro text' width="760" height="392" loading="eager" />
          <figcaption>The form itself — same photo, colors, and type as tvc.farm.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </header>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <h2>What each answer becomes</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">The form's own examples below are Sree &amp; Prameela's real, already-published answers — so you can see exactly where each one ends up on their actual card.</p>
        <div class="field-map">
          <div class="field-map-item">
            <div class="field-map-q">
              <span class="field-map-label">"What do you do today?"</span>
              <p class="field-map-note">Becomes the main paragraph on your card.</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/pages/members-story-guide/field-bio.jpg" alt="Sree and Prameela's bio rendered on their card, with their names shown as green links" width="838" height="165" loading="lazy" class="field-map-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="field-map-item">
            <div class="field-map-q">
              <span class="field-map-label">"Family"</span>
              <p class="field-map-note">Becomes its own line with a small icon. Add a LinkedIn link and your name turns green and clickable everywhere it's mentioned — here "Sree" and "Prameela" both link out, while "Sumant" (their son) is just bold, since no profile was given for him.</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/pages/members-story-guide/field-family.jpg" alt="Sree and Prameela's family line, with their own names linked and their son Sumant's name bolded but not linked" width="838" height="120" loading="lazy" class="field-map-img" />
          </div>
          <div class="field-map-item">
            <div class="field-map-q">
              <span class="field-map-label">"In one sentence, why are you part of TVC?"</span>
              <p class="field-map-note">Becomes an italic quote bubble. If you and a partner each submit your own, you each get your own bubble, credited by name.</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/pages/members-story-guide/field-quote.jpg" alt="Sree's why-TVC answer rendered as an italic quote bubble, credited to him by name" width="838" height="250" loading="lazy" class="field-map-img" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <h2>What happens after you submit</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li class="step">
            <div class="step-num">1</div>
            <h3>You submit</h3>
            <p>Pick your card from the name list and answer what you're comfortable with. If your card lists two people, either of you can submit — or you can each answer separately and we'll combine both.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <h3>We review it</h3>
            <p>Every response gets read before it goes anywhere near the site — mainly a language and tone check. Nothing is published automatically, by anyone, ever.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <h3>It gets added to your card</h3>
            <p>Once reviewed, your answers are added to the <a href="/people/members">Members page</a> at tvc.farm — but only the parts you said yes to publishing. If two of you each submitted separately, both get folded into one card, photos included.</p>
            <figure class="shot">
              <img src="/images/pages/members-story-guide/card-example.jpg" alt="Sree and Prameela's real member card popup, showing a photo, bio, family line with names highlighted, and two quotes on why they're part of TVC, one per person" width="838" height="1332" loading="lazy" />
              <figcaption>Sree &amp; Prameela's card, live on the Members page today.</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <div class="step-num">4</div>
            <h3>You can still change it</h3>
            <p>Come back and edit your answers anytime using the link on the confirmation page. We'll pick up the change the next time we update the site.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <div class="note-card">
        <h2>Before you fill it out</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>You'll need to sign in with Google</strong> to submit the form.</li>
          <li><strong>Your email is never published</strong> — the form captures it automatically from your Google sign-in, just so we can follow up if something needs clarifying.</li>
          <li><strong>Nothing goes live without your OK</strong> — the form ends with a yes/no question, and only "yes" responses get published.</li>
          <li><strong>One photo, or several</strong> — if you and a partner each want to upload your own, that's fine; the card will show both.</li>
          <li><strong>There's no fixed timeline</strong> — updates are batched by hand, not automated, so it may take a little while to appear.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <section class="doc-section">
        <h2>Questions people have asked</h2>
        <dl class="faq">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <dt>My partner and I want to answer separately — is that OK?</dt>
            <dd>Yes. Pick the same card each time and submit your own response — we'll merge both into one card, including separate photos and social links if you each add one.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <dt>I already have a bio on the site — why fill this out again?</dt>
            <dd>Most current bios are a single line from the old member directory, written around 2017. This is a chance to refresh what you do today and add the "why TVC" piece, which isn't on the site at all yet.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <dt>What if I'd rather skip the photo, family, or social link questions?</dt>
            <dd>Skip them. Only your name and the one-line "why TVC" answer are required — everything else is there if you want it, not because it's expected.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <dt>Who do I ask if something's wrong or missing?</dt>
            <dd>Email contact@tvc.farm — that's also where you can ask for something to be corrected or removed after it's published.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <div class="cta-block">
        <p class="lead">Ready to add your story?</p>
        <a class="button" href={FORM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the form</a>
        <p class="link-status">Takes about 5 minutes. You'll need to sign in with Google to submit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .doc {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tvc-green);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .doc-header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .subhead {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
  }

  .intro strong {
    color: var(--tvc-green-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .doc-section {
    margin-top: 56px;
  }

  .doc h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .section-intro {
    margin: -8px 0 28px;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .field-map {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .field-map-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .field-map-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--tvc-ink);
  }

  .field-map-note {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
  }

  .field-map-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--tvc-line);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .field-map-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* The steps below are a real, ordered sequence - submit, then review,
     then merge, then (optionally) edit - so a numbered timeline encodes
     something true, not just decoration. */
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .steps::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    bottom: 6px;
    left: 15px;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--tvc-line);
  }

  .step {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 32px 48px;
  }

  .step:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .step-num {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--tvc-line);
    color: var(--tvc-green-dark);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    margin: 3px 0 6px;
    color: var(--tvc-ink);
  }

  .step p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .step p a {
    color: var(--tvc-green-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  figure.shot {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
  }

  .step figure.shot {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  figure.shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--tvc-line);
  }

  figure.shot figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .note-card {
    background: var(--tvc-green-tint);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }

  .note-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .note-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .note-card li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
  }

  .note-card li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .note-card li strong {
    color: var(--tvc-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  dl.faq {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--tvc-line);
  }

  .faq-item:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  dt {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .cta-block {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--tvc-line);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-block p.lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: var(--tvc-ink);
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--tvc-orange-cta);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 13px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(247, 133, 32, 0.35);
  }

  .button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--tvc-green-dark);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .link-status {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--tvc-ink-soft);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .step {
      padding-left: 42px;
    }

    .steps::before {
      left: 13px;
    }

    .step-num {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
